  "final_answer_preview": "The distance between the basketball court and the largest tennis court is approximately **34.8 meters**.\n\n### Steps:\n1. **Basketball Court Centroid**: The highest-scoring basketball court detection had a centroid at (298.5, 660.5) pixels.\n2. **Tennis Court Centroid**: The largest tennis court had a centroid at (400, 400) pixels.\n3. **Pixel Distance**:  \n   $$\n   \\text{Distance} = \\sqrt{(400 - 298.5)^2 + (400 - 660.5)^2} \\approx 279.6 \\text{ pixels}\n   $$\n4. **Convert to Real-World Distance**:  \n",
  "final_answer_full": "The distance between the basketball court and the largest tennis court is approximately **34.8 meters**.\n\n### Steps:\n1. **Basketball Court Centroid**: The highest-scoring basketball court detection had a centroid at (298.5, 660.5) pixels.\n2. **Tennis Court Centroid**: The largest tennis court had a centroid at (400, 400) pixels.\n3. **Pixel Distance**:  \n   $$\n   \\text{Distance} = \\sqrt{(400 - 298.5)^2 + (400 - 660.5)^2} \\approx 279.6 \\text{ pixels}\n   $$\n4. **Convert to Real-World Distance**:  \n   $$\n   279.6 \\text{ pixels} \\times 0.124 \\text{ m/pixel} \\approx 34.8 \\text{ meters}\n   $$\n\n**Answer**: The distance is approximately **34.8 meters**.",
